'''Emerald Blade''' gains bonus {{Stat|dmg}} the more coins the wielder carries in their Purse.
=== Damage based on coins ===
<math>\mathrm{DMG} = 130 + 2.5 \times \mathrm{Coins}^{1/4}</math>

Although the damage in the description is rounded to 1 decimal place, it will be rounded to the nearest integer when it actually hits the mob.

The damage bonus from {{Ench|One For All}} works on the bonus damage.

